  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK&#x2013;Jamaica Exchange: Connecting Archives, Building Safer Futures</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project supports the Government of Jamaica in facilitating a professional exchange visit by Jamaican curators to leading UK cultural institutions that hold significant Jamaican heritage materials. Through direct engagement, the project builds skills, access, and partnerships that strengthen the role of museums and cultural spaces in using arts and culture to promote shared understanding and support non-violent futures.</narrative>
  </description>
